<section class="method-intro" aria-labelledby="method-h">
  <span class="mono-label eyebrow">Research approach</span>
  <h1 id="method-h">How we engineer for uncertainty</h1>
  <p class="standfirst">
    Large-scale engineering systems are committed to for decades, in conditions that cannot be
    forecast with confidence. Our method treats that uncertainty as a design variable, not an
    afterthought.
  </p>
  <p class="supporting">
    The four-step summary on our home page — model uncertainty, analyse risk, optimise design,
    support decisions — sits on top of a more detailed set of principles we apply consistently
    across our research and project work, from lunar resource value-chains to transport and
    energy infrastructure. This page sets those principles out in full.
  </p>
</section>

